      ["Pan jest z Gdańska.","pahn yehzd z GDAHNY-skah","You are from Gdańsk. (to a man)","Pan jest, never Pan jesteś. Gdańska is genitive after z."],
      ["Ona jest sympatyczna.","OH-nah yehst sihm-pah-TIHCH-nah","She is nice.","Feminine form. Not \"sympathetic\"."],
      ["Mam trzydzieści lat.","mahm tshih-JYEH-sh'chyee laht","I'm thirty.","Age is mam plus lat. Not a dative of the person."]
