      {"t":"type","p":"You do not know the fact. Start with Nie.","a":["Nie wiem"],"hint":"nie · wiedzieć · a fact","x":["znam","umiem"],"why":"A missing fact is nie wiem. Znam is a person, and umiem is a skill."}
